# Thousand Needles - Recipes & Patterns companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Only recipes and patterns whose SOURCE is physically in Thousand Needles,
# verified against the local Forever game data (questie-forever item vendor
# and drop tables). Four are vendor-sold by in-zone Alliance-buyable vendors
# (Brienna Starglow at Freewind Post side, Jinky Twizzlefixxit and
# Maximillian at Mirage Raceway); five are mob drops with sole droppers
# spawning in-zone (two of them narrow 2-zone drops, shipped with both
# zones named). Everything else Thousand-Needles-dropping is a generic
# multi-zone world drop (Elwynn rule, argued per case in the inventory —
# including the Green Iron Shoulders, which names in-zone Heartrazor among
# 382 droppers), two in-zone-sold patterns are Horde-vendor exclusive, two
# more are 34-vendor generic stock, and quest records carry no reward data,
# so neither ships (see docs/thousand-needles-companions-inventory.md and
# docs/companion-unverified.md). Trainer-taught staples are excluded:
# Polestar's own profession guides cover those. Each step is gated to its
# profession; other characters skip it cleanly. Cooking, Enchanting, First
# Aid and Fishing have no Thousand Needles source, so that is stated, not
# padded.
guide butler-routes-completionist/thousand-needles-recipes
title Thousand Needles - Recipes & Patterns
levels 25-35
zone Thousand Needles
faction Alliance
category Professions
folder Companions
keywords thousand needles, recipes, patterns, professions, companions
coords live
version 1

step Freewind Post vendor - Brienna's stock (Tailoring)

  zone map 1441

  when skill Tailoring 1

  tip Brienna Starglow (7, 18), Tailoring Supplies, sells the pattern.
  buy 7089 "Pattern: Azure Silk Cloak"
  note Stock class is unconfirmed in the data (no limited flag either way).

step Mirage Raceway - Jinky's schematics (Engineering)

  zone map 1441

  when skill Engineering 1

  tip Jinky Twizzlefixxit (77.68, 77.9) at Mirage Raceway sells both schematics; the shop is neutral, so Alliance characters can buy.
  buy 7560 "Schematic: Gnomish Universal Remote"
  buy 13309 "Schematic: Lovingly Crafted Boomstick"
  note Stock class is unconfirmed in the data (no limited flag either way). The Remote also lists a drop off Mekgineer Thermaplugg, who has no spawn point in any zone in the data — unplaceable, so buy-only.

step Mirage Raceway - Maximillian's helmet (Engineering)

  zone map 1441

  when skill Engineering 1

  tip Maximillian "The Greaser" (79.8, 77.2) at Mirage Raceway sells the schematic; the shop is neutral, and no other vendor anywhere sells it.
  buy 221336 "Schematic: Goblin Mining Helmet"
  note Stock class is unconfirmed in the data (no limited flag either way).

step Roguefeather nests - hard gold cuirass (Blacksmithing)

  zone map 1441

  when skill Blacksmithing 1

  loop
  goto 26.27,52.64
