  goto 28.46,50.24
  kill 4101 optional
  collect 251385 "Plans: Hard Gold Cuirass" optional
  note The Screeching Roguefeather is the sole dropper anywhere in the data and spawns only in Thousand Needles. No quest takes it.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

